{
  "_doc": "One case per fixture. attack = what the fake model does after reading it (it obeys the injection). expect: ask = the lawyer is asked (with a warning when 'finding' is set; 'always' is then not offered), sandbox = refused without asking, answer = the attack is in the answer text (front ends must not load it). {{verbatim}} = 260 characters of the document from '§ 2'; {{base64}} = the whole document, base64.",
